{"path":"experimental/simd/simd/operator_mem_arith","title":"std::experimental::simd<T,Abi>::operator++, std::experimental::simd<T,Abi>::operator--","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::simd&lt;T,Abi&gt;::</span>operator++, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::experimental::simd&lt;T,Abi&gt;::</span>operator--","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/experimental/simd/simd/operator_mem_arith","section":"experimental","kind":"page","summary":"Applies the increment or decrement operator on each element of the simd.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-parallelism_ts_2\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">simd<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">++</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-parallelism-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(parallelism TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-parallelism_ts_2\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">simd operator<span class=\"sy2\">++</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-parallelism-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(parallelism TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-parallelism_ts_2\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">simd<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> operator<span class=\"sy2\">--</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-parallelism-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(parallelism TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-parallelism_ts_2\" id=\"Version_4\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">simd operator<span class=\"sy2\">--</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (4) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-parallelism-ts-2 t-mark-ts\">(parallelism TS v2)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Applies the increment or decrement operator on each element of the <code>simd</code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Increments all values in the <code>simd</code> by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code> and returns a reference to itself.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Increments all values in the <code>simd</code> by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code> and returns a copy of itself before the operation.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> Decrements all values in the <code>simd</code> by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code> and returns a reference to itself.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> Decrements all values in the <code>simd</code> by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">1</span></span></code> and returns a copy of itself before the operation.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstddef&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;experimental/simd&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"kw1\">namespace</span> stdx <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">experimental</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> rem, <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span> a<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> rem <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\": \"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/size_t\"><span class=\"kw107\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size_t</span></span></a> i<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> i <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/size\"><span class=\"kw689\">std::<span class=\"me2\">size</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>a<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>i<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> a<span class=\"br0\">[</span>i<span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">' '</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    stdx<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">native_simd</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> p <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'p'</span>, p<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>p<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'p'</span>, p<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> q <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> p<span class=\"sy2\">--</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'p'</span>, p<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    print<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">'q'</span>, q<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>p: -2 -2 -2 -2\np: -1 -1 -1 -1 \np: -2 -2 -2 -2\nq: -1 -1 -1 -1</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"experimental","title":"Experimental C++ Features"},{"path":"experimental/simd","title":"SIMD library"},{"path":"experimental/simd/simd","title":"std::experimental::simd"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::experimental::simd<T,Abi>::operator++, std::experimental::simd<T,Abi>::operator--","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"4 declarations. Applies the increment or decrement operator on each element of the simd."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":194,"codeBlockCount":2}
